<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>His name above all names shall stand,</l><l>Exalted more and more,</l><l>At God the Father’s own right hand,</l><l>Where angel hosts adore.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Redeemer, Savior, Friend of man</l><l>Once ruined by the fall,</l><l>Thou hast devised salvation’s plan,</l><l>For Thou hast died for all.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>His name shall be the Counsellor,</l><l>The mighty Prince of Peace,</l><l>Of all earth’s kingdoms, Conqueror,</l><l>Whose reign shall never cease.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
